// src/std/json/json.zen
// the folder's public surface: starred re-exports only.
//
// The writer half is the value, its arena and the streaming `Nest` —
// a reply assembles as text with no arena behind it, and that is why
// `Nest` is surface and not an implementation detail. The reader half
// is the scanner and its faults. Nothing here allocates a value tree;
// a document model is not what this module is.

JsonId*, Run*, Pair*, Json*, Jsons*,
    write_text*, written*, Nest*, obj*, arr* = std.json.json_write

JsonFault*, MAX_NESTING*, Reader*, read*,
    fine* = std.json.json_read
